# Engine half

This repo holds two halves. This chat owns the **conditioning engine** only. Read `docs/ownership-halves.md` before editing.

- Branch: `cursor/engine-<short-task>` from the current engine line. A known remote is `origin/codex/engine-web-cloudflare`. Confirm that checkout contains an engine root before editing.
- Lane check: `pnpm run verify:engine`.
- Capgo channel for this half is `engine-html`. Do not publish unless the user explicitly authorizes that release.
- Do not merge to `main` from this chat unless the user explicitly asks.

## Owned paths

- `packages/adaptive/**` — Open / Next / Close conditioning math
- `apps/athlete/conditioning/**` — engine HTML
- `apps/engine-web/**` — hosted engine web
- `scripts/conditioning/**` — engine build and zone configuration

## Strength half is out of bounds

Do not edit these in an engine branch:

- `apps/shared/strength-*.js`
- `apps/shared/training-core.js`
- `apps/athlete/strength-*.js`
- `apps/athlete/library*.js`
- `apps/athlete/logger.js`
- `apps/athlete/session.js`
- `apps/athlete/release.json`
- `checks/browser/strength-brain-v2.spec.mjs`

`origin/main` can be a strength-only tree. `pnpm run verify:engine` exits 1 there until an engine root is checked out. Switch branches. Do not copy engine files onto `main` to make the command pass.

## Shared files

Stop and report overlap before editing `supabase/`, `apps/athlete/hybrid-integrations.js`, `apps/athlete/plan-sync.js`, `apps/athlete/whoop-common.js`, or `apps/shared/whoop-common.js`. One half edits a shared file at a time.
